    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "HONG KONG\npotato dumplings and red cabbage.\nT-66\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktaitio\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody MaryScrewdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum\nPremium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nDelikatessen Auswahl\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nRostbraten dieses Fluges\nToday's roast, a selected cut of aged beef roasted on board and caved to order\nRehrückenschnitten mit Wacholder Beeren und Pfifferlinge\nSliced saddle of venison with juniper berries and Chanterelles mushrooms\nHühnerbrust in Riesling Sosse\nSautéed boneless breast of chicken in creamy sauce flavored with Riesling wine\nSeezungenfilets Kardinal\nFillets of Sole in a lobster sauce with prawns and truffles\nUnser Tagesgericht\nSpecialty of the day\nAusgewähltes Gartengemüse\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nKartoffeln nach Hausrezept\nPotatoes Maison\nGemischter Salat",
      "Sautéed boneless breast of chicken in creamy sauce flavored with Riesling wine\nSeezungenfilets Kardinal\nFillets of Sole in a lobster sauce with prawns and truffles\nKaffee\nCoffee\nUnser Tagesgericht\nSpecialty of the day\nAusgewähltes Gartengemüse\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nKartoffeln nach Hausrezept\nPotatoes Maison\nGemischter Salat\nTossed garden salad\nKäsebrett und Fruchtkorb\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nNachtisch\nDessert\nKoffeinfreier Kaffee\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTee\nTea\nSelected Red and White Wines\nFor your special enjoyment, a German white wine\nhas been added to our selection on today's flight\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine Crème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau\nKahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\n243.KG\nFlight\nFancy\nROAST GOOSE\nGänsebraten\nA German speciality, meticulously authentic,\nfeaturing succulent roast goose; served with\npotato dumplings and red cabbage.\nT-66",
      "HONG KONG\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad.\nThis painting is part of the Fiye Art Museum's collection in Seattle, Washington.\nHONG KONG Harbor is one of the busiest in all Asia. It bustles with ferries... carving half a million\npassengers a day....and freighters and endless junks and sampans. At Aberdeen, vou will find a\nwhole village of people who live all their lives on boats. Across the harbor in Kowloon, shops and\nstalls bulge with merchandise as shoppers bargain noisily. The Furama Inter-Continental is centrally\nlocated and provides a wide range of amenities. Pan Am serves Hong Kong every day on its\nRound-The-World flights, from New York via Tokyo and nonstop from San Francisco.\nOPAN AM.\n2002.016.007"
    ],
